flowchart TD
  A["Task with 3+ steps"] --> B["Write PLAN.md with acceptance and steps"]
  B --> C["Mark one step doing"]
  C --> D["Do step"]
  D --> E["Run its check"]
  E --> F{"Passed?"}
  F -- yes --> G["Mark verified with evidence"]
  F -- no --> H["Mark failed, add fix step"]
  G --> I{"More steps?"}
  H --> C
  I -- yes --> C
  I -- no --> J["Report; unchecked boxes = incomplete"]
